  "traiteur-afterwork-pot-depart-entreprise-paris": {
    "titre": "Organising an after-work event or a leaving party at the office in Paris: formats, quantities and budget",
    "metaTitle": "Organising an after-work event or leaving party",
    "extrait": "After-work event or leaving party at the office: which format, how many canapés per person, which drinks, what budget. The planning guide.",
    "enBref": [
      "Allow 6 to 8 canapés per person for a one- to two-hour after-work event, 16 to 18 for a dinner reception.",
      "At L'Écrin Traiteur, L'Invitation (8 canapés) costs €29.90 per person excl. VAT and La Célébration (16 canapés) €51.90 excl. VAT.",
      "Halal and pork-free menu, alcohol-free drinks; delivery €29 excl. VAT, order until 2 pm the day before."
    ],
    "contenu": "\n      <p>The <strong>after-work event</strong> and the <strong>leaving party</strong> have become essential rituals of office life. A colleague moving on, a team wrapping up a project, a new hire to welcome: these informal moments bring teams together far more than a meeting does. You still have to get them right. Here is how to organise an after-work event or a leaving party at the office in Paris, from choosing the platters to the budget. If you are looking for the packages directly, everything is on our <a href=\"/occasions/afterwork-entreprise\">corporate after-work catering</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>After-work events, leaving parties, welcome drinks: moments that matter</h2>\n      <p>A <strong>corporate after-work event</strong> takes place at the end of the day, over a few bites and a drink, in a relaxed atmosphere. The <strong>leaving party</strong> marks a transition: it is the moment to say thank you and to look back. Welcome drinks greet a new hire, the end-of-project gathering celebrates an achievement. In every case, the logic is the same: friendliness, sharing and something to nibble without turning the room into a canteen. A buffet set in the middle of the table creates an instant connection.</p>\n\n      <h2>Aperitif platters or dinner reception: which to choose?</h2>\n      <p>For a short after-work event, sharing <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-aperitifs\">aperitif platters</a> are enough: mini baguettes, club sandwiches, wraps, cheese or charcuterie platters, crudités and dips. For a more significant leaving party or an evening that runs on, a <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">dinner reception</a> takes over: more elaborate savoury and sweet canapés, in sufficient quantity to stand in for a standing dinner. The choice depends on the time, the length and the importance of the occasion.</p>\n\n      <h2>How many canapés per person for an after-work event?</h2>\n      <p>The question always comes up. For an <strong>aperitif after-work event</strong> lasting one to two hours, allow 6 to 8 savoury and sweet canapés per person. For a <strong>dinner reception</strong> that replaces dinner, go up to 16 to 18 canapés per person. It is better to plan a little generously: an after-work event that runs out of bites ends early, whereas a slight surplus gets shared until the end. These benchmarks apply to an adult audience in a work setting.</p>\n\n      <h2>Drinks: mocktails, soft drinks and the alcohol-free option</h2>\n      <p>A successful after-work event does not require alcohol. A <strong>mocktail bar</strong> made to order, infused waters, artisan juices: an alcohol-free offer is expected today and means no one is left out. It also suits a professional audience and a workplace wellbeing approach very well. We put together the drinks menu to match your atmosphere, with or without a live station.</p>\n\n      <h2>Budget for an after-work event or a leaving party at the office</h2>\n      <p>The budget for a <strong>leaving party at the office</strong> depends on the format and the number of guests. An aperitif after-work event remains affordable; a full, more generous dinner reception naturally costs more. The best approach is a quote based on your headcount, your time slot and your wishes, rather than a standard rate. We put it together within 24 hours, with company invoicing and delivery anywhere in Paris and Île-de-France.</p>\n\n      <h2>Delivery and set-up in Paris and Île-de-France</h2>\n      <p>L'Écrin Traiteur delivers and, if needed, sets up your platters and your reception directly on your premises, in Paris and across Île-de-France. Hand-made bites, careful presentation, a clean set-up: all you have to do is enjoy the moment with your teams. Find the packages and prices on our <a href=\"/occasions/afterwork-entreprise\">corporate after-work catering in Paris</a> page, or <a href=\"/devis\">request your quote</a> directly.</p>\n\n      <h2>Sources</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Packages and canapés: <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">cocktail reception packages</a> and <a href=\"/occasions/afterwork-entreprise\">after-work page</a>, accessed 15 October 2026.</li>\n      </ul>\n    ",
    "faq": [
      {
        "q": "How many canapés per person should you plan for an after-work event?",
        "a": "For an aperitif after-work event lasting one to two hours, allow 6 to 8 savoury and sweet canapés per person. For a dinner reception that replaces dinner, plan 16 to 18 canapés per person. It is better to plan a little generously: an after-work event that runs out of bites ends early."
      },
      {
        "q": "What budget should you plan for a leaving party at the office?",
        "a": "It depends on the format: an aperitif after-work event remains affordable, a full dinner reception naturally costs more. We prepare a quote based on your headcount, your time slot and your wishes, with a reply within 24 hours and company invoicing."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you offer an alcohol-free option for after-work events?",
        "a": "Yes. A mocktail bar made to order, infused waters, artisan juices: the alcohol-free offer is complete and suited to a professional audience. It means no one is left out while keeping the friendly spirit of the moment."
      },
      {
        "q": "How much notice do you need for an after-work event or a leaving party?",
        "a": "An order before 2 pm the day before is enough for most formats. For a larger reception or a live station, it is better to allow a few days so we can settle the selection and the logistics. Delivery from 6:30 am in Paris and Île-de-France."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you set up the buffet on site?",
        "a": "Yes, set-up is possible. We deliver and, if needed, set up your platters and your reception directly on your premises in Paris and Île-de-France, with careful presentation, so that all you have to do is enjoy the moment."
      }
    ]
  },
