    "extrait": "Gennevilliers is the other side of La Défense: Société Générale, EDF and Hermès towers, different logistics from Puteaux. How to order a caterer there.",
    "contenu": "\n      <p>Gennevilliers is home to the head offices of giants. It is not Paris, and not quite La Défense either. It has its own logistics, with its own access points, hours and strict procedures.</p>\n\n      <h2>Gennevilliers: logistical specifics</h2>\n      <p>Quai de Seine, boulevard de la République, cours Michelet. Access is controlled. Deliveries run from 6:30 am to 6 pm, with a badge or via reception.</p>\n      <p><strong>What you need to give:</strong></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Exact address + building + floor</li>\n        <li>Precise delivery time (not a time window)</li>\n        <li>Name + phone number of the direct contact</li>\n        <li>Access restrictions (badge? call? reception?)</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>Breakfast in Gennevilliers: formulas</h2>\n      <p><strong>Classique formula</strong> (€8 per person excl. VAT)</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>2 butter pastries</li>\n        <li>Alain Milliat juice, 2 L</li>\n        <li>Hot coffee thermos</li>\n        <li>Basket of fresh fruit</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Budget for 20 people = €160 excl. VAT + €29 excl. VAT delivery = <strong>€189 excl. VAT</strong></p>\n\n      <p><strong>Complet formula</strong> (€12 to €16 per person excl. VAT)</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>The Classique base</li>\n        <li>Madeleines or loaf cakes</li>\n        <li>Farmhouse yoghurts</li>\n        <li>Wider selection of juices</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Budget for 20 people = €240 to €320 excl. VAT + €29 excl. VAT delivery = <strong>€269 to €349 excl. VAT</strong></p>\n\n      <h2>Lunch trays in Gennevilliers</h2>\n      <p><strong>Essentiel tray</strong> (€28.90 per person excl. VAT)</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Simple starter</li>\n        <li>Quality main course</li>\n        <li>Small dessert</li>\n        <li>Bread + butter</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p>For 10 people = €289 excl. VAT + €29 delivery = <strong>€318 excl. VAT</strong></p>\n\n      <h2>After-work drinks in Gennevilliers</h2>\n      <p><strong>L'Invitation cocktail reception</strong> (€29.90 per person excl. VAT, 8 canapés)</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Savoury and sweet mix</li>\n        <li>Ready to serve</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Budget for 40 people = €1,196 excl. VAT + €29 excl. VAT delivery = <strong>€1,225 excl. VAT</strong></p>\n\n      <h2>Lead times and ordering</h2>\n      <p>€50 minimum order (excl. VAT). Order before 2 pm the day before for delivery between 6:30 am and 6 pm. We know the Gennevilliers access points inside out.</p>\n\n      <p>Find the details of our formulas and prices on our dedicated page <a href=\"/traiteur/gennevilliers\">corporate caterer in Gennevilliers</a>, our page <a href=\"/petit-dejeuner-entreprise/gennevilliers\">office breakfast in Gennevilliers</a>, or <a href=\"/devis\">ask directly for a quote</a> for your team.</p>\n    ",
